# A trainer of Hoenn (Emerald's MUS_VS_TRAINER): a square lead in G minor that leaps an octave and runs down by step,
# over a pumping bass and a hard snare, with a brighter turn to B-flat before the loop. Original composition for this
# game (plan 21 · H2).
title Battle! Trainer (Hoenn)
tempo 168
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.16

track lead square lowhp=sawlead vol=0.84 pan=0.05 rev=0.18
  o5 g8 o6 g8 o5 g8 o6 g8 o5 f+8 o6 f+8 o5 f+8 o6 f+8 | o5 g4 g4 d4 r4 | L o5 g4 o6 g4 f4 d4 | o6 e-4 d8 c8 o5 b-2 |
